sequenceDiagram
    actor Driver
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant S as System
    
    note over Driver, S: 1 — Driver Requests Delivery Assignment
    Driver->>GW: Request Deliveries
    GW->>S: request delivery assignment
    S-->>GW: Delivery request initiated
    GW-->>Driver: Delivery request initiated

    note over S: 2 — Fetch Oldest Pending Delivery Order
    S-->>S: fetching oldest pending order

    alt No pending orders
        S-->>Driver: No pending delivery orders available
    end

    note over S: 3 — Build & Optimise Delivery Route
    S-->>S: Build and optimize route

    note over S: 4 — Mark Orders On-Route & Notify Driver
    S-->>S: Mark orders as collected { orderIds }

    loop For each order
        S-->>S: update delivery status to on_route
        S-->>S: update order status to collected
    end

    S-->>S: orders collected
    S-->>Driver: driver_route [{ orderId, location }]
